<title>UK: UniChem buys 11 British pharmacies.</title>
<headline>UniChem buys 11 British pharmacies.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>British drug wholesaler and retailer UniChem Plc said on Monday it bought 11 community pharmacies in England and Scotland for about 4.0 million stg.</p>
<p>UniChem said the pharmacies would form part of its Moss Chemists chain.</p>
<p>The company paid for the shares in stock and cash.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
